  <item>
    <title>Pulaski County: data center moratorium — Rejected</title>
    <link>https://aigridwatch.com/communities/pulaski-county-ar</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">mora-pulaski-county-ar</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 13 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description>Multiple attempts failed: a May 26 vote appeared to pass but a tally error voided it (didn&#x27;t reach the 10-vote two-thirds threshold); a revised version was explicitly voted down 10-3 on Jul 28. County now pursuing regulations instead</description>
